# SBD Network - Canonical AI Rules & Guidelines

## 🏗️ PROJECT CONTEXT & TECH STACK
- Location: /Users/achugustave/Documents/Marriageducation/sbd-network
- Frontend: HTML5, Mobile-first responsive CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+).
- Backend: Firebase SDK 9.22.0 (Auth, Firestore, Storage, Hosting, Cloud Functions).
- Design System: Dark theme, card-based layouts, Cyan accent color (#00bcd4).

## 💎 SUBSCRIPTION TIERS & ACCESS SYSTEM
- Free ($0): Teleios Week 1 only, Resource library, Community read-only.
- Foundation ($9/mo): Full Teleios Blueprint (6 weeks), SBD For Dummies (13 weeks), School 1 progressive unlock.
- Premium ($20/mo): Full School 1 (13 courses) + School 2 (15 courses), Certificates.
- Elite ($50/mo): All 4 Schools (44 courses total), MV House access, Advanced boards, Mastery certification.

## 🎓 SCHOOL FIRESTORE TRACKING IDs
- School 1: school-1-teleios
- School 2: school-2-sexual-literacy
- School 3: school-3-marriage-systems (Elite Only)
- School 4: school-4-civilization-leadership (Elite Only)

## 🔐 ABSOLUTE DEVELOPMENT RULES
1. CODE STYLE: Write clean modular Vanilla JS. Never add framework boilerplate (React/Vue) or heavy external libraries unless explicitly asked.
2. BACKEND/DATABASE: Always write Firestore queries matching Firebase SDK 9 v2 configuration syntax. Never mix old v8 namespaced patterns.
3. SECURITY FIRST: When suggesting updates to data endpoints, remind the user to crosscheck security configurations in `firestore.rules`. Ensure any group/board check evaluates the `requiredTier` string correctly.
4. STYLING ARCHITECTURE: Restrict interface enhancements to CSS grids, flexbox layouts, and the default dark theme parameters with the cyan element mapping (#00bcd4).
